@@ -21,6 +21,15 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape report
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or refreshes a landscape report, aggregating the results of multiple analyses found under an analysis root (the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands). Creates `<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and the `index.html` report next to it.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same as `analyzeLandscape` (same options and behaviour), kept for existing scripts.
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for the available options.
+
